{
  "name": "dsh-open-exit-animation",
  "version": "0.3.1",
  "private": false,
  "description": "DeepSeek Harness 开场与退场动画：默认纯代码自绘（5 套可切换样式：鲸鱼光扫 / 极简脉冲 / 星尘汇聚 / 打字机 / 雷达环），也可以换成用户自己的视频 / 动图（存在浏览器本地库 IndexedDB，不上传不联网）；可调速度、粒子、主色、文案、静音、素材最长播放、画面适配；设置 → 开关动画 里即时改。打开 DSH 播开场片头；配合桌面壳补丁，托盘退出 / 退出应用会先播完退场动画（点 X 关窗默认只隐藏到托盘、不播，可在面板里打开）。",
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "animation",
    "splash",
    "intro",
    "outro"
  ],
  "type": "module",
  "main": "./lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "default": "./lib/index.js"
    },
    "./client": {
      "default": "./lib/client.js"
    },
    "./package.json": "./package.json",
    "./cordis.patch.yml": "./cordis.patch.yml"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "tools",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "preview.html",
    "README.md",
    "LICENSE"
  ],
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/samsam560/dog-kjdh.git"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/samsam560/dog-kjdh#readme",
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/samsam560/dog-kjdh/issues"
  },
  "author": "samsam560",
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-slots"
      ],
      "platform": "web"
    },
    "engines": {
      "dsh": ">=0.1.5-rc.1"
    }
  },
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=20"
  },
  "license": "MIT"
}
